        "original_id": "ac32119a-3f28-5c34-bc27-1adc6385e177",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Kevin Woo, Epic Mazur, Park Jimin, Jae\n- Organizations: XING Entertainment\n- Shows: After School Club\n- Bands: Crazy Town\n- Songs: Butterfly\n- Places: California, South Korea\n\nFacts:\n- Epic Mazur was born as Bret Hadley Mazur on August 31, 1970, and he is an American vocalist, rapper, and record producer.\n- Kevin Woo was born as Christopher Thomas Woo on November 25, 1991, and he is an American singer, actor, and television host based in South Korea.\n- Kevin Woo was born and raised in California.\n- Kevin Woo was discovered by XING Entertainment at age fifteen and then moved to South Korea.\n- Epic Mazur is best known as a founder and frontman of the band Crazy Town and for its hit song \"Butterfly.\"\n- After School Club is a South Korean internet-based live-music request television talk show.\n- After School Club is often shortened to ASC.\n- After School Club is co-hosted by Kevin Woo, Park Jimin, and Jae.\n- Park Jimin is also an MC on After School Club.",
